### Communication Service — HTTP smoke tests
### Primary delivery is via Kafka (notification-events topic).
### These endpoints allow manual triggers for testing or admin use.
### Mailhog UI: http://localhost:8025 — view captured emails in local dev.
### ── Health Check ────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8084/health
###
### ── Send Email Notification (manual trigger) ───────────────────

POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "to": "client@example.com",
  "subject": "Your case has been assigned",
  "body": "Dear Client,\n\nYour case 'Smith vs. Jones' has been assigned to Lawyer Smith.\n\nRegards,\nLawForYou Platform",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "correlationId": "{{correlationId}}"
}
###
### ── Send SMS Notification (manual trigger — stub in dev) ───────
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SMS",
  "to": "+94771234567",
  "body": "LawForYou: Your case has been assigned to Lawyer Smith.",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "correlationId": "{{correlationId}}"
}
###
### ── Via API Gateway (port 8080) ────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "to": "admin@lawforyou.dev",
  "subject": "Test via Gateway",
  "body": "This notification was sent via the API Gateway.",
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "correlationId": "{{correlationId}}"
}
